 StandardForm_WithButtonsCentered;parms;n;globalParms
⍝ Presents a standard form with a status bar and three centered buttons, "OK", "Help" and "Close"
 globalParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 parms←##.GUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'MyForm'
 parms.alignButtons←##.GUI.Enums.Align.Center
 :If ⍬ ⍬≡parms.size
     parms.size←200 400
 :EndIf
 parms.minSize←100 200
 n←##.GUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 ##.GUI.StdForm.AddButtons n('OK' 'Help' 'Cancel')
 #.⎕SHADOW'OnSelect'
 #._APLGUI.OnSelect←{⎕←((0⊃⍵).Caption),' was pressed' ⋄ n←GUI.APLGuiUtils.GetRefTo_n 0⊃⍵ ⋄ n.∆CloseForm}
 n.∆buttons.onSelect←⊂'#._APLGUI.OnSelect'
 n.VersionNo.Text←1⊃##.GUI.APLGuiAdmin.Version

 n.∆Form.Wait
 n.∆CloseForm
 #._APLGUI.⎕EX'OnSelect'
⍝Done
